WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Dr. Khalifa: [10:68] ... Be He glorified. He is the Most Rich. To Him belongs everything in the heavens and everything on earth. You have no proof to support such an utterance. Do you say about GOD what you do not know?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
So obviously in this verse, God is angry with the statement that "God has begotten a son",

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
and this is in reference to Jesus.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Because Jesus himself didn't say that he is the only son of God.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Jesus said "all the righteous are children of God."

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
And there's a famous verse that says "blessed are the peacemakers for they shall be children of God." (Matthew 5:9)

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.000
In fact, he said "sons of God."

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
So, all the righteous are sons of God or children of God and all the unrighteous are children of Satan.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
And this is throughout the Gospels, all the four Gospels show that.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
And this is why, [10:68] ... Do you say about GOD what you do not know?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Now, If we... now that we know the Greatness of God, we can see the blasphemy of saying that "God has begotten his son."

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
It's like saying you have given birth to a virus or a bacteria. (unintelligible)

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
You know, it's so ridiculous. It's not even that. It's...

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
